%% VaultMCP sync — read, write happy path, write conflict

sequenceDiagram
    participant Sess as Claude Code
    participant FS as Local mirror
    participant Agent as Agent
    participant MCP as Master MCP
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Sub as Other agents

    Note over Sess: read flow
    Sess->>FS: read apps/inv/README.md
    FS-->>Sess: content (instant, local)

    Note over Sess: write flow (happy)
    Sess->>FS: write apps/inv/README.md
    FS->>Agent: file change
    Agent->>MCP: wiki.write(path, content, base_version=42)
    MCP->>DB: INSERT pages, INSERT events
    DB-->>MCP: version=43
    MCP-->>Agent: 200 {version: 43}
    DB-->>Sub: NOTIFY events_channel
    Sub->>Sub: SSE: PageChanged, apply locally

    Note over Sess: write flow (conflict)
    Sess->>FS: write apps/inv/README.md
    FS->>Agent: file change
    Agent->>MCP: wiki.write(..., base_version=42)
    MCP->>DB: SELECT version
    DB-->>MCP: 43 (someone else wrote)
    MCP-->>Agent: 409 {current_version: 43, current_content: Z}
    Agent->>FS: replace local with Z
    Agent->>Sess: notify "conflict"
